# Kernel module trees left out of the netinstall ISO's live system: hardware
# the installer never uses. Paths are under usr/lib/modules/<version>/kernel/.
# scripts/module-noextract.sh also leaves out every module that depends on one
# of these (GPU drivers need cec from media, some HID drivers need snd), so
# nothing that stays is left unloadable.
#
# The console needs no GPU driver: it stays on the UEFI framebuffer
# (simpledrm, built into the kernel). Bluetooth stays: Redpine (rsi) Wi-Fi
# drivers depend on it.
drivers/gpu
drivers/accel
drivers/media
sound
drivers/iio
drivers/infiniband
drivers/staging
kheaders.ko

